{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o093b","title":"曹操决漳水灌邺","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o093b-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操毁土山地道，作围堑引漳水灌城，城中饿死者甚多。","evidence":["wudi-e-o093b-q"]},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o060c-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"曹操深堑决漳水灌邺城饿死过半","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o060c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"水攻","evidence":["wudi-e-o093b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0208","role":"守城","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o060c-q"]}],"place":{"text":"邺、漳水","evidence":["wudi-e-o093b-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安九年五月","year":204,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o093b-q","wudi-q-o092","wudi-q-b-6787e3ddd3e334b677d4"],"chronology":"wudi-y204","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o092","basis":"建安九年五月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,508,"O093b"],"order":220}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0208","name":"审配","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o060c-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-523fd61ee056a488fead","layer":"original","quote":"太祖遂围之，为堑，周四十里。初令浅，示若可越。配望而笑之，不出争利〖10〗。太祖一夜掘之，广深二丈；决漳水以灌之。自五月至八月，城中饿死者过半。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":341,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":125,"end":197,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o093b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b849d99c230efe708c30","layer":"original","quote":"五月，毁土山、地道；作围堑，决漳水灌城〖9〗。城中饿死者过半。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":507,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":64,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-6787e3ddd3e334b677d4","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-6787e3ddd3e334b677d4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗九年：建安九年（公元 204）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":510,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c8fff97bafc82c655f3f","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o092","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3e549c423b15df48398a","layer":"original","quote":"九年春正月〖1〗，济河，遏淇水入白沟以通粮道〖2〗。二月，尚复攻谭，留苏由、审配守邺〖3〗。公进军到洹水〖4〗，由降；既至，攻邺，为土山、地道。武安长尹楷屯毛城〖5〗，通上党粮道〖6〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":506,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
